# Same CIF-derived periodic crystal; relax atomic coordinates and orthogonal cell
# to zero normal stress, as a TSCBOP lattice-compatibility diagnostic.
# This is a separate test and its endpoint is not substituted into the QSGS model.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data potential_validation/ti3sic2_bulk_tscbop/ti3sic2_bulk_3x3x2.data
pair_style tersoff
pair_coeff * * potentials/TSCBOP.tersoff Ti Si C
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
variable fn atom sqrt(fx*fx+fy*fy+fz*fz)
compute fmax all reduce max v_fn
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step atoms pe press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz c_fmax
fix relax all box/relax aniso 0.0 vmax 0.0005
min_style cg
minimize 1.0e-8 1.0e-4 3000 30000
unfix relax
run 0
write_data potential_validation/ti3sic2_bulk_tscbop/zero_pressure_minimized.data
write_dump all custom potential_validation/ti3sic2_bulk_tscbop/zero_pressure_forces.dump id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id
